e</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Basic.html#MPN.W32.toNat\">toNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice.getD\">getD</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice.getD\">getD</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A number of two limbs is `s₀ + β s₁`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.toNat_of_size_eq_two","kind":"theorem","line":932,"name":"MPN.W32.toNat_of_size_eq_two","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L932-L939"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.divRem2_spec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">divRem2_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"de