ml#MPN.W32.divRem2\">divRem2</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">d₁</span> <span class=\"fn\">d₀</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">d₁</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">d₀</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`divRem2` divides: `a = q d + r` with `r < d`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.divRem2_spec","kind":"theorem","line":799,"name":"MPN.W32.divRem2_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L799-L930"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2_eq\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">div2_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">d₀</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2\">div2</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">d₁</span> <span class=\"fn\">d₀</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.divRem2\">divRem2</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">d₁</span> <span class=\"fn\">d₀</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2_eq","kind":"theorem","line":784,"name":"MPN.W32.div2_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L784-L790"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">div2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">d₀</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`divRem2` without the remainder: the fold ends with the array alone, so that it allocates no pair\nand no box for the remainder.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2","kind":"def","line":765,"name":"MPN.W32.div2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L765-L782"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.divRem2\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">divRem2</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">d₀</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`a / d` as limbs, untrimmed, and `a % d` as a word, for `d = d₁ β + d₀` with `d₁ ≠ 0`, like GMP's\n`mpn_divrem_2`: the quotient limbs of `a 2ˢ` by the normalized `D` in a new array, from the top\nlimb down, with `div32Step` on the limbs of `a 2ˢ` read from `a` with `shlLimbU`. If the last\nremainder is not below `D`, a check failed, which never happens, and the division is redone with\n`div2Step` on a shifted copy (`divRem2Limbs`), as it is for arrays too long for `USize` indices.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.divRem2","kind":"def","line":742,"name":"MPN.W32.divRem2","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L742-L763"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div32Step_spec\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">div32Step_spec</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">D </span><span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div32Step\">div32Step</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">D</span> <span class=\"fn\">R</span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">D</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">R</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">D</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>   <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div32Step\">div32Step</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">D</span> <span class=\"fn\">R</span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.fst\">fst</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">R</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HDiv.hDiv\">/</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">D</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>     <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div32Step\">div32Step</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <span class=\"fn\">D</span> <span class=\"fn\">R</span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">R</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> <span class=\"fn\">32</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32.toNat\">toNat</a></span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMod.hMod\">%</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">D</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#UInt64.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`div32Step` is correct when its remainder is below `D`: then so was the remainder before it, and\nit computed the quotient limb and the remainder.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div32Step_spec","kind":"theorem","line":420,"name":"MPN.W32.div32Step_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L420-L433"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div32Step\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">div32Step</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">D </span><span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One step of division by `D` with the reciprocal `v`: the quotient limb and remainder of `R β + x`\nby `D`, for `R < D`, by Möller and Granlund's 3-by-2 step, with its corrections as arithmetic, and\nchecked. A remainder of `D` or more means that the check failed, there or in an earlier step.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div32Step","kind":"def","line":302,"name":"MPN.W32.div32Step","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L302-L317"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.recip32\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">recip32</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">D</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The reciprocal `⌊(β³ - 1) / D⌋ - β` of a normalized `D`, by one `div2Step`.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.recip32","kind":"def","line":288,"name":"MPN.W32.recip32","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L288-L290"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2Step_spec\"><span cl