PN.W32.div2Est\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">div2Est</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">vt</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`min ⌊R / vt⌋ (β - 1)`, the first estimate of a quotient limb (`qEstimate` of the two limbs of\n`R`). It tests the high half instead of comparing with `2³²`: the kernel would otherwise unfold\nthe literal while checking the loop that uses it.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2Est","kind":"def","line":173,"name":"MPN.W32.div2Est","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L173-L180"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2Fix\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">div2Fix</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">vt </span><span class=\"fn\">vs</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">q</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt32\">UInt32</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decreases `q` while `q (vt β + vs)` exceeds `R β + x`, then returns `q` with the remainder\n`R β + x - q (vt β + vs)`, all in words.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.html#MPN.W32.div2Fix","kind":"def","line":31,"name":"MPN.W32.div2Fix","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/DivTwo.lean#L31-L50"}}],"imports":["Init","MPN32.Bits","MPN32.Div.Basecase"],"instances":[],"name":"MPN32.Arch.DivTwo"}